      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While part of this is now untrue (proximity is better respected than before), being able to specify whether or not a glow should be on a pickup would be very helpful for immersion, puzzle worlds, intuitive systems and such.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
