  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-07T11:27:31.397Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The blue pickup collider outline effect is not wanted in every world. The same goes for the haptic feedback and the UI line that is drawn. All those effects are immersion breaking. \nGiven that the 'Proximity' value can't be set to zero and is also not accurately respected by VRChat, we lack a usable system for small pickups that stay close to a player hand and are not permanently accidently selected all the time which is frustrating for the player.\nThere are also cases where pickups are used for e.g. a multipoint gun system and the outline effect is giving away what should be invisible to the player because it's just an invisible attachement point.",
